Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-145: laptop package 108's designer part merged
 into the machine tree -- ES02's 0.144-0.145 (0.145.0)

GitHub main 5de3e3d (GitLab 7a3c28a7), mixed; its C++ / web part = the integration session's cpp 0071 (02598f6).
Three-way on the package's base_c723bfdb (= package 107), CRLF to LF first: extension.js, package.json,
WPF_DIFF_LOG.md, test/smoke_extension.js changed only by ES02 (taken); CHANGELOG.md, HANDOVER.md on both sides
(git merge-file, no conflict; the result keeps the machine's tools 0136-0138 notes). lib/aliasedit.js (the machine's
Alias patch) is not in the package: the machine's copy stays.
ES02's 0.144: Find (Ctrl+Shift+F) -- one box, a scope list (this file / this project / the solution / C++ / web /
BCB6, Big5 read), case / whole word / regex; 0.145: Ctrl+F opens the same box, "this file" by default (VS Code's own
find, F3), setting ht9045Designer.ctrlFFind turns it off; its key is when editorFocus, so the CSV table's and the
designer's own Ctrl+F (webviews) are not taken -- to be confirmed in the real VS Code.
The package's message says 0.144; its package.json says 0.145 (package 109's README corrects it).
HANDOVER.md section 5: packages 108 / 109, take the version from package.json, tests are safe while wb_serve runs.
Tests: lib 176/176, probe 7/7 + tab tree 7/7, extension 211/211, panels all pass; e2e_build.ps1 not run.

